<div class="rn">
<h2>What&#x27;s New in 4.9.1</h2>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Suppress unread indicators for empty threads.</li>
<li>Reset existing destinations to the built-in default.</li>
<li>Surface workspace activity and unread status.</li>
<li>Preserve activity across socket reconnects.</li>
<li>Report program activity and unseen output.</li>
<li>Preserve running indicators during navigation.</li>
</ul>
<p class="more">Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.9.1">https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.9.1</a></p>
